# Keep raw/private material out of git by default.
raw/**
!raw/
!raw/README.md
private/**
!private/


# Recoverable caches: restore from URLs, versions, hashes and commits retained in citation/reading records.
# Paper PDFs and the full extracted TeX tree (figures included) are tracked.
**/paper-tex/archives/
**/profile/profile/

**/github-repo/
